<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money market supply cut in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money market supply cut in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank said it withdrew liquidity from the money market in the week to Aug 26.</p>
<p>(figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   407.58 (-  0.74)</p>
<p>Advances against pledged security  15.36 (+  0.30)  Commercial bills			  3.30 (unch)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   22.82 (unch)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 104.71 (-  6.10)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
